WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
magnificent destiny.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.160
Everybody in this room is a part of it in your own way.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.340
Each of us inherits the deeds and the myths,

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.840
the triumphs, the legacies of our own heroes and

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.940
founders who so bravely showed us the way.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.480
Our ancestors gave everything for homelands

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.620
that they defended with pride, with sweat, with

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.719
blood, with life, and with death.

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:29.580
Now the righteous task of protecting the nations

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.599
that they built belongs to each and every one of us.

